          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Выберите **Клавиатуры**"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap **Open Settings** below" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap **Open Settings** below"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Нажмите **«Открыть Настройки»** ниже"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap the ⚙︎ key on the keyboard to change word suggestions, next-word suggestions, learning speed, the long-press delay and the theme. Settings are saved on this device." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap the ⚙︎ key on the keyboard to change word suggestions, next-word suggestions, learning speed, the long-press delay and the theme. Settings are saved on this device."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Нажмите клавишу ⚙︎ на клавиатуре, чтобы настроить подсказки слов, подсказку следующего слова, скорость обучения, задержку долгого нажатия и тему. Настройки сохраняются на этом устройстве."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Russian layout with two changes: the hard sign (ъ) and the palochka (Ӏ) have their own keys, where щ and э are on the Russian keyboard." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Russian layout with two changes: the hard sign (ъ) and the palochka (Ӏ) have their own keys, where щ and э are on the Russian keyboard."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Русская раскладка с двумя отличиями: твёрдый знак (ъ) и палочка (Ӏ) — на отдельных клавишах, там, где на русской клавиатуре щ и э."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The built-in dictionary has about 1,350 Tsakhur words. It works offline and is the same for everyone; your own words are kept separately." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The built-in dictionary has about 1,350 Tsakhur words. It works offline and is the same for everyone; your own words are kept separately."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Во встроенном словаре около 1 350 цахурских слов. Он работает офлайн и одинаков для всех; ваши собственные слова хранятся отдельно."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The keyboard learns the words you type. Its **Dictionary** page lists them; you can delete one word or all of them there." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The keyboard learns the words you type. Its **Dictionary** page lists them; you can delete one word or all of them there."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Клавиатура запоминает слова, которые вы набираете. Они перечислены на странице **«Словарь»** в её настройках; там можно удалить одно слово или все сразу."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The mark ʼ after a soft consonant (йигъылʼ, мизʼ) is under ь, and лʼ is under л." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The mark ʼ after a soft consonant (йигъылʼ, мизʼ) is under ь, and лʼ is under л."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Знак ʼ после мягкого согласного (йигъылʼ, мизʼ) — долгое нажатие на ь, а лʼ — на л."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tip: you can also add the keyboard via **Settings → General → Keyboard → Keyboards**" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tip: you can also add the keyboard via **Settings → General → Keyboard → Keyboards**"
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Подсказка: клавиатуру также можно добавить через **Настройки → Основные → Клавиатура → Клавиатуры**"
          }
        }
      }
    },
